      "side": 1,
      "message": "dexpreopt should really take the entire boot classpath. It\u0027s a limitation of the platform and SH consequences that we pass just a subset. I know we\u0027re special casing the build system again, but it has all the information here (are we compiling a system server jar? where are the dex files? etc).",
